                    <occupation>Lawyer/Agent</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p> Son of Robert Faulder bookseller 46 New Bond-st. Robert Faulder was
                            buried 21.7.1815 His eldest son Joseph was executor of his will along
                            with James White. Thomas, (baptised 8 December 1789) accounts for the T.
                            Faulder entries in the Diary. It is possible that the 'Faulder attny' entries refer to Thomas - since
                            it seems possible that Thomas Faulder went on to become an agent for a canal company in Middlesex in 1860, but we have left these uncoded.</p>
